    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in a serene countryside position, the property enjoys a calm, scenic backdrop with mature and expansive gardens. The long gravel driveway creates an elegant arrival, enhancing the sense of space and seclusion. \nA welcoming central hall sets the tone for the generous proportions throughout. There is a cosy living room on the left with a stove, ideal for relaxed in the evenings.\nSecond reception room on the right with an open fireplace, perfect for entertaining as it also links to the kitchen diner. \nSpacious and bright open plan kitchen/dining area which is the hub of the home with French doors opening directly to the rear garden.\nA standout feature of this home is the triple aspect family room with vaulted ceilings, abundant natural light, and stove creating a stunning and luxurious space for unwinding.\nSeparate utility room which is practical and well designed, with further rear access and a separate WC and dedicated airing cupboard.\nLocated upstairs are four double bedrooms, all generously sized and filled with natural light.\nThe Master bedroom benefits from an ensuite and walk in wardrobe.\nMain family bathroom with bath and shower over.\nMature landscaped gardens beautifully maintained with boundary hedging and sweeping lawns offering space, privacy, and versatility.\nSpacious Garage and workshops, ideal for storage, hobbies, or projects.\nThere is also a separate snug with wood burner, a charming hideaway, perfect as a retreat or creative space.\n\nThe property is located just minutes outside the Village of Bunclody and only 28mins from the M9 and 23mins from the M11 Motorways. \n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
